{
  "schema_version": "1.0",
  "encounter_id": "00452",
  "segments": [
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0001",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 1.0,
      "end_seconds": 4.6,
      "duration_seconds": 3.6,
      "text": "Oh, morning, doctor, I hope I'm not interrupting."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0002",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 5.8,
      "end_seconds": 9.28,
      "duration_seconds": 3.48,
      "text": "That's alright, take a seat. Tell me why you've come."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0003",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "FAMILY_MEMBER",
      "start_seconds": 10.55,
      "end_seconds": 15.92,
      "duration_seconds": 5.37,
      "text": "Well, hello, doctor. I hope it's alright if I stay in for this."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0004",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 16.7,
      "end_seconds": 19.56,
      "duration_seconds": 2.86,
      "text": "Good, that'll be useful. Pull up a chair."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0005",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "FAMILY_MEMBER",
      "start_seconds": 20.63,
      "end_seconds": 23.56,
      "duration_seconds": 2.93,
      "text": "She's been having more breathlessness than usual, doctor."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0006",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 24.13,
      "end_seconds": 25.99,
      "duration_seconds": 1.86,
      "text": "And when did that start?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0007",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 27.42,
      "end_seconds": 33.85,
      "duration_seconds": 6.43,
      "text": "I've had it since last Tuesday. My family kept telling me to get it checked."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0008",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 35.11,
      "end_seconds": 37.35,
      "duration_seconds": 2.24,
      "text": "Do you notice anything setting it off?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0009",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 38.51,
      "end_seconds": 39.99,
      "duration_seconds": 1.48,
      "text": "It's worse with walking."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0010",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 41.55,
      "end_seconds": 43.09,
      "duration_seconds": 1.54,
      "text": "And how severe is it?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0011",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 44.33,
      "end_seconds": 45.67,
      "duration_seconds": 1.34,
      "text": "It's severe, honestly."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0012",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 47.16,
      "end_seconds": 49.82,
      "duration_seconds": 2.66,
      "text": "What about a wheeze, have you noticed that?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0013",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 50.23,
      "end_seconds": 51.52,
      "duration_seconds": 1.29,
      "text": "Yes, I have."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0014",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 52.17,
      "end_seconds": 59.25,
      "duration_seconds": 7.08,
      "text": "Can you describe it a bit more for me? How strong it is, what the pattern is, what helps."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0015",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 59.67,
      "end_seconds": 74.26,
      "duration_seconds": 14.59,
      "text": "Okay, so it happens a couple of times a week. It's severe, honestly. I've also had poor sleep because of the cough, for five days. And there's a rattling chest as well, about four days now."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0016",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 75.25,
      "end_seconds": 77.58,
      "duration_seconds": 2.33,
      "text": "Any chest pain or coughing up blood?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0017",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 78.17,
      "end_seconds": 79.75,
      "duration_seconds": 1.58,
      "text": "Nothing like that, no."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0018",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 80.44,
      "end_seconds": 83.09,
      "duration_seconds": 2.65,
      "text": "Any swollen ankles or weight loss at all?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0019",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 84.43,
      "end_seconds": 87.2,
      "duration_seconds": 2.77,
      "text": "No. None of those, uh, no."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0020",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 88.08,
      "end_seconds": 90.87,
      "duration_seconds": 2.79,
      "text": "Okay, any problems with your joints or muscles?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0021",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 92.47,
      "end_seconds": 93.71,
      "duration_seconds": 1.24,
      "text": "No, nothing there."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0022",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 97.51,
      "end_seconds": 104.06,
      "duration_seconds": 6.55,
      "text": "Any medication at the moment, including things from the pharmacy? Bear with me, I'm just building up the picture."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0023",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 105.62,
      "end_seconds": 121.48,
      "duration_seconds": 15.86,
      "text": "Tiotropium inhaler, once a day for my chest. I took the morning off to come in today. I wasn't sure whether to come in at all, to be honest. Telmisartan, 40 milligrams, maybe, once a day."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0024",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 121.91,
      "end_seconds": 125.73,
      "duration_seconds": 3.82,
      "text": "Do you have the packet or the prescription with you?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0025",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 127.02,
      "end_seconds": 129.61,
      "duration_seconds": 2.59,
      "text": "No, uh, it's at home."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0026",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 130.65,
      "end_seconds": 135.08,
      "duration_seconds": 4.43,
      "text": "Okay, what about family history, any illnesses that run in the family?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0027",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 136.27,
      "end_seconds": 140.34,
      "duration_seconds": 4.07,
      "text": "My sister has thyroid problems. My grandmother had breast cancer."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0028",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 141.66,
      "end_seconds": 142.81,
      "duration_seconds": 1.15,
      "text": "Do you smoke?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0029",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 143.44,
      "end_seconds": 146.56,
      "duration_seconds": 3.12,
      "text": "I smoke, yes, around five a day."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0030",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 148.07,
      "end_seconds": 149.52,
      "duration_seconds": 1.45,
      "text": "And alcohol, how much?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0031",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 149.85,
      "end_seconds": 153.21,
      "duration_seconds": 3.36,
      "text": "I gave up drinking about three years ago."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0032",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 155.99,
      "end_seconds": 160.48,
      "duration_seconds": 4.49,
      "text": "Do you have any allergies to medicines, food, anything at all?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0033",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 161.32,
      "end_seconds": 163.32,
      "duration_seconds": 2.0,
      "text": "Not that I know, no."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0034",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 164.45,
      "end_seconds": 170.06,
      "duration_seconds": 5.61,
      "text": "What about your general health, any conditions you're being treated for? Take your time, there's no rush."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0035",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 171.13,
      "end_seconds": 176.87,
      "duration_seconds": 5.74,
      "text": "I've got COPD. I thought it would sort itself out, but it hasn't."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0036",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 177.53,
      "end_seconds": 178.23,
      "duration_seconds": 0.7,
      "text": "Alright."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0037",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 179.25,
      "end_seconds": 181.12,
      "duration_seconds": 1.87,
      "text": "I've got high blood pressure."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0038",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 183.99,
      "end_seconds": 191.23,
      "duration_seconds": 7.24,
      "text": "Yes, I can see the high blood pressure in your file as well. Have you had any previous surgeries?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0039",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 192.33,
      "end_seconds": 194.28,
      "duration_seconds": 1.95,
      "text": "No, never had any surgery."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0040",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 196.73,
      "end_seconds": 199.61,
      "duration_seconds": 2.88,
      "text": "Let's get your blood pressure and the other basics."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0041",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 206.66,
      "end_seconds": 208.16,
      "duration_seconds": 1.5,
      "text": "Just relax your arm..."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0042",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 225.84,
      "end_seconds": 232.76,
      "duration_seconds": 6.92,
      "text": "Okay: SpO2 89 percent on room air, respiratory rate 23. And BP is 130 over 88, pulse 84."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0043",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 233.27,
      "end_seconds": 234.4,
      "duration_seconds": 1.13,
      "text": "Is that normal?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0044",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 235.86,
      "end_seconds": 239.45,
      "duration_seconds": 3.59,
      "text": "Alright, we'll put it in context in a moment."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0045",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 241.33,
      "end_seconds": 244.88,
      "duration_seconds": 3.55,
      "text": "Alright, I'd like to examine you now. Please come over here."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0046",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 246.04,
      "end_seconds": 246.74,
      "duration_seconds": 0.7,
      "text": "Alright."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0047",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 248.42,
      "end_seconds": 250.2,
      "duration_seconds": 1.78,
      "text": "Just relax, I'll be quick."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0048",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 265.23,
      "end_seconds": 269.33,
      "duration_seconds": 4.1,
      "text": "Air entry is reduced on both sides with a prolonged breathing out phase."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0049",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 270.29,
      "end_seconds": 272.85,
      "duration_seconds": 2.56,
      "text": "Now I'm going to check this part."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0050",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 285.48,
      "end_seconds": 288.56,
      "duration_seconds": 3.08,
      "text": "There's some wheeze, and no swelling in the legs."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0051",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 293.22,
      "end_seconds": 313.58,
      "duration_seconds": 20.36,
      "text": "Okay, you can sit back up. Good, that's all I need to examine. Let me gather my thoughts and then we'll talk it through together. Right, here's what I'm thinking. This looks most like a flare-up of COPD. It could also be pneumonia, so we'll keep that open. I'm going to order blood tests, for infective exacerbation."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0052",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 313.99,
      "end_seconds": 337.42,
      "duration_seconds": 23.43,
      "text": "I'm going to order a sputum culture, for productive cough. I'd rather check than guess, and this is the quickest way to know more. I'm going to order a chest X-ray, for breathlessness. I'll start you on prednisolone, 30 milligrams, once a day, for five days. That's for COPD flare-up. I'll put all of this in writing so you don't have to remember it."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0053",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 338.96,
      "end_seconds": 362.95,
      "duration_seconds": 23.99,
      "text": "This is a good time to talk about stopping smoking if that's still an issue. Make sure you're drinking plenty of fluids, two to three litres a day if you can, and get proper rest. Avoid taking any extra painkillers on top of what I'm prescribing without checking with us. And please bring the latest prescription or the medicine boxes to the next visit, so we can settle the dose."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0054",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 363.83,
      "end_seconds": 365.06,
      "duration_seconds": 1.23,
      "text": "Okay, I will."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0055",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 365.66,
      "end_seconds": 372.54,
      "duration_seconds": 6.88,
      "text": "I want you to come back or go to emergency straight away if you become more breathless or your lips turn blue."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0056",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 373.38,
      "end_seconds": 375.16,
      "duration_seconds": 1.78,
      "text": "Got it, thank you."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0057",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 376.52,
      "end_seconds": 383.27,
      "duration_seconds": 6.75,
      "text": "I'd like to see you again in one week. Right, that's all I have. Is there anything you wanted to ask?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0058",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 384.24,
      "end_seconds": 387.35,
      "duration_seconds": 3.11,
      "text": "That's all, thank you for your time."
    }
  ]
}